y_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.30800633,35.31486269]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"東町二丁目公園","category":"nature","address":"中郡大磯町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"14341","municipality_pref":"神奈川県","municipality_name":"大磯町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.3243606,35.31403152]}}],"display_comment_original":"大磯町周辺には、近世村の記憶として高麗寺村、大磯宿、西小磯村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡、古墳や貝塚に関わる場所が見え、鴫立庵、馬場台遺跡、東昌寺のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、高麗寺村、大磯宿ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["中島湘煙","安田靫彦","加山又造","後藤濶","佐藤竜雄"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["六所神社（柳田大明神、六所明神、六所明神社）","高来神社（鷄足山高麗寺大權現、高麗權現社）","鷄足山雲上院高麗寺（廃寺）","高麗山","高麗山公園（湘南平）","高麗山県民の森","鴫立沢","鴫立沢は「湘南」という地名が発祥した場所としても挙げられる。"],"specialties":["珊瑚"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E7%A3%AF%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q521066","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3571973","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3194396","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q6378050","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7688325","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11560425","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11522999","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11473729","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11452965","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11522983","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q106722986","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11468813","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11355203"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"大磯町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110642687","wikidata_qid":"Q385023","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E7%A3%AF%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}